{"4085720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Legendary Heroes - A Game Of Death ", "steam_appid": 4085720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085720/extras/9399e7a5cbc9d61234ba8ea465aa9f1a.poster.avif?t=1771882870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085720/extras/9399e7a5cbc9d61234ba8ea465aa9f1a.webm?t=1771882870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085720/extras/9399e7a5cbc9d61234ba8ea465aa9f1a.mp4?t=1771882870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SKILL-BASED GAMEPLAY</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>BEAT-EM-UP ROOTS</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>OPEN FIELD ENVIRONMENTS</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>HIGH-SPEED PACE</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>RELENTLESS ENEMIES AND HAZARDS AT EVERY TURN</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Visit our </i><strong><i><u>Discord</u></i></strong><i> for updated details and NIGHTLY BUILDS!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong> </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary Heroes is a true return to form to classic 2D arcade action. With fluid hand-drawn animation, real-time environmental physics and maximum full gameplay movement control- it all comes to head against exceedingly powerful opponents to match high velocity force!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085720/extras/118fb6466863bd161421309620845f90.poster.avif?t=1771882870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085720/extras/118fb6466863bd161421309620845f90.webm?t=1771882870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085720/extras/118fb6466863bd161421309620845f90.mp4?t=1771882870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard Fighting game mechanics- frame cancels, plinking and much more!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handdrawn 2D animation</strong> in full high resolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High energy soundtrack</strong>= full arcade mood!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-Field gameplay</strong>. You keep the pace of the action...and so does your opposition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless pace</strong>- the action is as fast as you make it and as fast as you can keep up. Remain stoic with a predominantly defensive style, or go masher-HAM on auto-combos to calm down the hordes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy personalities</strong> make their styles- they're opponents, not targets! They can attack and defend as well as you and without mercy as equally! They'll gang up on you, counter your attacks and blast you backwards faster than you can blink. So look out for every foe's particular style and learn to counter them for each situation!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Boss</strong> is a different lesson. Defense, Offense, Agility and endurance are all tested!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085720/extras/fb6155a240899df984c2bfc58850d5d9.poster.avif?t=1771882870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085720/extras/fb6155a240899df984c2bfc58850d5d9.webm?t=1771882870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085720/extras/fb6155a240899df984c2bfc58850d5d9.mp4?t=1771882870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MODES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Campaign</strong>- Opening Temple, Barcelona Castles, Hong Kong, and Warehouse Hangar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kumite Survival Chaos</strong>- 100 man challenger per round, with only one life at the start. Move upward in an RNG paced swap of 4 levels that are merciless against everyone equally. Player and Enemy alike!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Rush Mode</strong>- a visit to a dark temple that houses the strongest fighters in the game. Test yourself against their methods and figure out strategies to battle in the main campaign </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY STYLE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>in-play arcade pick up system</strong>. No progression unlocking! You have all of your abilities from the beginning, BUT you also can buff your character to gain temporary upgrades in battle. From gradual healing, to armor and even a counter Silent Bomber mode attack to get back at the explosive-happy army out there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085720/extras/f77ab083f8c241fac523fc9125aea47f.poster.avif?t=1771882870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085720/extras/f77ab083f8c241fac523fc9125aea47f.webm?t=1771882870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085720/extras/f77ab083f8c241fac523fc9125aea47f.mp4?t=1771882870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your skill, your mind and your dexterity= your skill level! </strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085720/extras/ad4248c8dde0356ab1803c059f8e9034.poster.avif?t=1771882870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085720/extras/ad4248c8dde0356ab1803c059f8e9034.webm?t=1771882870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085720/extras/ad4248c8dde0356ab1803c059f8e9034.mp4?t=1771882870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085720/extras/23e6e2a5640b6212c32c794a010bccab.poster.avif?t=1771882870\" width=560 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085720/extras/23e6e2a5640b6212c32c794a010bccab.webm?t=1771882870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085720/extras/63b66316a7e4c077bfe1bacd902a5e66.poster.avif?t=1771882870\" width=500 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085720/extras/63b